     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Eligibility:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " you must graduate from an entry-level PA program accredited by ARC-PA to take PANCE."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Six years, six attempts:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " for first-time candidates, after graduating you can take PANCE for up to six years, at most six times; once either runs out, eligibility is lost and the only way back is to complete an accredited PA program again."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "The exam:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " five blocks of 60 questions, 60 minutes per block; 45 minutes of break time in total, plus a 15-minute tutorial."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "PA-C:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " after passing PANCE you are NCCPA board certified and may use the legally protected PA-C mark for as long as your certification stays current."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Licensure depends on it:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " all 50 states, DC, the US territories and the military rely on NCCPA certification as one of the criteria for employment, licensure or regulation of PAs."
     }
    ]
   }
